<div id="fast-track" v-cloak>
  <div purpose="hero-section">
    <img purpose="hero-art" alt="" src="/images/fast-track-hero-background-1000x1326@2x.jpg">
    <div purpose="section-inner">
      <div purpose="hero-text">
        <h1>Putting off your MDM migration?</h1>
        <p>Not enough people, not enough time, and no way to know if it’ll be worth the effort.</p>
        <div purpose="button-row">
          <a purpose="cta-button" href="/contact?talkToUs">Talk to us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="preview-section">
    <div purpose="section-inner">
      <div purpose="section-text">
        <h2>See Fleet running with your devices before you commit</h2>
        <p purpose="lead"><span purpose="highlight">On-site or in Zoom</span>, Fleet engineers set up Fleet in your environment, with your real devices.</p>
        <p purpose="note">Fleet safely runs alongside your existing MDM during migration.</p>
      </div>
      <div purpose="dashboard-image">
        <img alt="The Fleet dashboard showing hosts active, hosts enrolled, software, and activity." src="/images/fast-track-dashboard-644x424@2x.jpg">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="certification-section">
    <div purpose="section-inner">
      <div purpose="section-text">
        <h2>Get certified while we’re with you</h2>
        <p purpose="lead">Your team learns as you go, receiving Fleet certifications for Windows and Apple management.</p>
      </div>
      <div purpose="photo-collage">
        <img purpose="photo-celebration" alt="A Fleet customer holding a giant chocolate bar" src="/images/fast-track-certification-celebration-600x450@2x.jpg">
        <img purpose="photo-classroom" alt="A Fleet engineer helping an attendee in a Fast-track training room" src="/images/fast-track-certification-classroom-600x450@2x.jpg">
        <img purpose="photo-training" alt="Fleet engineers and attendees working together on laptops" src="/images/fast-track-certification-training-400x533@2x.jpg">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="translate-section">
    <div purpose="section-inner">
      <div purpose="section-text">
        <h2>No time to translate? We’ll do it for you.</h2>
        <p purpose="lead">Fleet’s IT engineers translate your policies and smart groups from Jamf and their equivalents from Entra and Intune.</p>
      </div>
      <img purpose="swan" alt="" src="/images/fast-track-swan-250x320@2x.png">
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="team-section">
    <div purpose="section-inner">
      <div purpose="section-text">
        <h2>Work with people who have done it</h2>
        <p purpose="lead">Our support team is available 24 hrs/day on weekdays, and responds in under an hour. We will make sure Fleet works for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div purpose="team-photos">
        <img alt="A member of the Fleet team" src="/images/fast-track-support-team-1-256x256@2x.jpg">
        <img alt="A member of the Fleet team" src="/images/fast-track-support-team-2-256x256@2x.jpg">
        <img alt="A member of the Fleet team" src="/images/fast-track-support-team-3-256x256@2x.jpg">
        <img alt="A member of the Fleet team" src="/images/fast-track-support-team-4-256x256@2x.jpg">
        <img alt="A member of the Fleet team" src="/images/fast-track-support-team-5-256x256@2x.jpg">
        <img alt="A member of the Fleet team" src="/images/fast-track-support-team-6-256x256@2x.jpg">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="results-section">
    <div purpose="section-inner">
      <div purpose="section-text">
        <h2>What teams get back</h2>
        <p purpose="lead">After switching to Fleet, customers report getting their time back:</p>
        <ul purpose="results-list">
          <li>50-80% less maintenance</li>
          <li>99% fewer tickets during new hire setup</li>
          <li>40 minutes or less to set up a new hire</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div purpose="customer-logos">
        <div purpose="logo-cell"><img alt="NVIDIA logo" src="/images/logos/logo-nvidia-color-161x32@2x.png"></div>
        <div purpose="logo-cell"><img alt="Stripe logo" src="/images/social-proof-logo-stripe-67x32@2x.png"></div>
        <div purpose="logo-cell"><img alt="Reddit logo" src="/images/logo-reddit-96x28@2x.png"></div>
        <div purpose="logo-cell"><img alt="Pinterest logo" src="/images/logo-pinterest-108x20@2x.png"></div>
        <div purpose="logo-cell"><img alt="Epic Games logo" src="/images/logos/logo-epic-games-40x46@2x.png"></div>
        <div purpose="logo-cell"><img alt="Mollie logo" src="/images/mollie-logo-136x40@2x.png"></div>
      </div>
      <p purpose="logos-caption">+ 5/8 of this year’s hottest IPOs</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="page-container">
    <div purpose="page-content">
      <div purpose="features-section">
        <div purpose="section-heading">
          <h1>What’s included</h1>
          <p>Fast-track focuses on Fleet feature fundamentals and the device management workflows your team needs on day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-row">
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>Live setup with Fleet experts</h4>
            <p>Configure Fleet to match your requirements and align with best practices.</p>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>AI device management</h4>
            <p>AI device management workflows configured from day 1. Approve every change, undo any mistake, and repeat what works.</p>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>No time to translate, we’ll do it for you</h4>
            <p>Export your profiles, and make sure settings, applications, and scripts are scoped to the correct devices.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-row">
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>Enrollment workflows</h4>
            <p>Automate zero-touch enrollment and tackle migration to Fleet from your current management service.</p>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>Policy, compliance, and encryption</h4>
            <p>Configure OS update enforcement, auto-patching, and FileVault and BitLocker settings.</p>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>Software management</h4>
            <p>Deploy custom software packages, use Fleet-maintained apps, and your platform’s app store.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-row" class="mb-0">
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>Onboarding and offboarding</h4>
            <p>Build predictable, secure device provisioning and repurposing processes.</p>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature">
            <h4>Integrations</h4>
            <p>Connect Fleet to your IdP, GitOps repo, logging tools, or any other part of your stack.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div purpose="quote-section">
        <div purpose="quote">
          <p purpose="quote-text">Having Fleet on site was phenomenal! Their professionalism and commitment to ensuring our use cases were managed was some of the best customer partnership we've ever seen.</p>
          <p purpose="quote-author">Jonathan Keyes</p>
          <p purpose="quote-author-role">Director of Project Management at Hawx</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div purpose="checklist-section">
        <div purpose="checklist-with-image">
          <div purpose="product-image">
            <img alt="The controls page of Fleet." src="/images/fast-track-product-image-1054x856@2x.png">
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-text">
            <h1>How it works</h1>
            <p>Fast-track is delivered on-site or over Zoom, over 3-5 days. Each session includes:</p>
            <div purpose="checklist">
              <p purpose="checklist-item">Live configuration with Fleet experts</p>
              <p purpose="checklist-item">Creation of critical workflows</p>
              <p purpose="checklist-item">Validation testing in production</p>
              <p purpose="checklist-item">Documentation of all completed work</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div purpose="page-section">
        <div purpose="accordion">
          <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
          <div purpose="accordion-body">
            <div purpose="accordion-item">
              <p purpose="accordion-header" id="accordion__header1" class="accordion" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion__body1" aria-controls="accordion__body1">
                Is it any good?
                <span class="fa fa-angle-down"></span>
              </p>
              <p purpose="acordion-item-text" id="accordion__body1" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="accordion__header1">
                A Fast-track will deliver a working Fleet deployment, tested enrollment workflows, policies and controls, software deployment, remediation, onboarding and offboarding strategies, and clear next steps to make Fleet ready for use in production.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div purpose="accordion-item">
              <p purpose="accordion-header" id="accordion__header2" class="accordion" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion__body2" aria-controls="accordion__body2">
                Does a Fast-track engagement include migration from our current MDM?
                <span class="fa fa-angle-down"></span>
              </p>
              <p purpose="acordion-item-text" id="accordion__body2" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="accordion__header2">
                A five-day Fast-track engagement can include MDM device migration.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div purpose="accordion-item">
              <p purpose="accordion-header" id="accordion__header3" class="accordion" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion__body3" aria-controls="accordion__body3">
                Who should attend the Fast-track?
                <span class="fa fa-angle-down"></span>
              </p>
              <p purpose="acordion-item-text" id="accordion__body3" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="accordion__header3">
                Anyone responsible for day-to-day management of your organization’s devices is welcome to attend.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div purpose="accordion-item">
              <p purpose="accordion-header" id="accordion__header4" class="accordion" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion__body4" aria-controls="accordion__body4">
                What do we need to prepare?
                <span class="fa fa-angle-down"></span>
              </p>
              <p purpose="acordion-item-text" id="accordion__body4" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="accordion__header4">
                Requirements for every organization are different. Fleet will gather your requirements and help you prepare a project plan for your Fast-track engagement.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="closing-section">
    <div purpose="section-inner">
      <div purpose="closing-text">
        <h2>We’ve helped hundreds of teams</h2>
        <p purpose="lead">Let’s plan your next 90 days with Fleet.</p>
        <div purpose="button-row">
          <a purpose="cta-button" href="/contact?talkToUs">Talk to us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div purpose="migration-logos">
        <p purpose="migration-label">Make the move from:</p>
        <div purpose="migration-logo-row">
          <img alt="Microsoft Intune logo" src="/images/logo-microsoft-intune-129x18@2x.png">
          <img alt="Jamf logo" src="/images/logo-jamf-64x22@2x.png">
          <img purpose="tall-logo" alt="Workspace ONE UEM logo" src="/images/logo-workspace-one-70x60@2x.png">
          <img alt="Patch My PC logo" src="/images/logo-patch-my-pc-93x22@2x.png">
          <img alt="Ivanti logo" src="/images/logo-ivanti-62x22@2x.png">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div purpose="bottom-gradient">
    <cloud-city></cloud-city>
  </div>
</div>
